{"2941900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Valor & Blade", "steam_appid": 2941900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valor &amp; Blade</strong> is a focused, Souls-inspired action RPG centered on deliberate combat, consistency, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a cursed gothic dungeon that reshapes itself every cycle. While the dungeon layout changes, enemy encounters remain consistent, allowing players to refine their skill, timing, and positioning through repetition rather than progression grinding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an intentionally compact experience designed for players who value combat clarity, fairness, and mastery over large worlds or broad content variety.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Souls-Inspired Combat</strong><br>Deliberate combat focused on timing, positioning, and learning enemy patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/2d5dcb03db52f3338228b30dfe00b1df.poster.avif?t=1768336690\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/2d5dcb03db52f3338228b30dfe00b1df.webm?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/2d5dcb03db52f3338228b30dfe00b1df.mp4?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 <strong>Procedurally Generated Dungeon Layouts</strong><br>A single gothic dungeon reshapes itself every cycle, offering new paths and room configurations while preserving encounter consistency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/93e8362086218100da5befd96592293e.poster.avif?t=1768336690\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/93e8362086218100da5befd96592293e.webm?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/93e8362086218100da5befd96592293e.mp4?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Cycle-Based Structure</strong><br>Defeat the dungeon’s final trial to begin a new cycle as the dungeon rearranges itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/8b379a224fb608b6cd34223e94cc09b4.poster.avif?t=1768336690\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/8b379a224fb608b6cd34223e94cc09b4.webm?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/8b379a224fb608b6cd34223e94cc09b4.mp4?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Mastery Through Repetition</strong><br>A small, focused enemy roster designed to reward pattern recognition and player improvement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/01842ce29b9647e4ae23bb761c5b1d7e.poster.avif?t=1768336690\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/01842ce29b9647e4ae23bb761c5b1d7e.webm?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/01842ce29b9647e4ae23bb761c5b1d7e.mp4?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗡️ <strong>Face The Eternal Warden</strong><br>A heightened enemy encounter that serves as the dungeon’s final trial each cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/6e24814271c5724697aac73bc27e0696.poster.avif?t=1768336690\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/6e24814271c5724697aac73bc27e0696.webm?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/6e24814271c5724697aac73bc27e0696.mp4?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Skill-Focused Progression</strong><br>Low-level progression places emphasis on player skill rather than stat scaling or grinding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT TO EXPECT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valor &amp; Blade is intentionally minimalist in scope.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>one gothic dungeon</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy types and behaviors <strong>do not change between cycles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy variety is limited and designed for mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss encounters are an elite variant rather than cinematic multi-phase battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenge comes from learning encounters, refining execution, and adapting to new dungeon layouts rather than discovering new content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CURRENT VERSION NOTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the <strong>1.0 launch</strong> of Valor &amp; Blade.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience is compact and focused</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional content and features may be added post-launch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player feedback will help shape future updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valor &amp; Blade</strong> is a focused, Souls-inspired action RPG centered on deliberate combat, consistency, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a cursed gothic dungeon that reshapes itself every cycle. While the dungeon layout changes, enemy encounters remain consistent, allowing players to refine their skill, timing, and positioning through repetition rather than progression grinding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an intentionally compact experience designed for players who value combat clarity, fairness, and mastery over large worlds or broad content variety.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Souls-Inspired Combat</strong><br>Deliberate combat focused on timing, positioning, and learning enemy patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/2d5dcb03db52f3338228b30dfe00b1df.poster.avif?t=1768336690\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/2d5dcb03db52f3338228b30dfe00b1df.webm?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/2d5dcb03db52f3338228b30dfe00b1df.mp4?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 <strong>Procedurally Generated Dungeon Layouts</strong><br>A single gothic dungeon reshapes itself every cycle, offering new paths and room configurations while preserving encounter consistency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/93e8362086218100da5befd96592293e.poster.avif?t=1768336690\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/93e8362086218100da5befd96592293e.webm?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/93e8362086218100da5befd96592293e.mp4?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Cycle-Based Structure</strong><br>Defeat the dungeon’s final trial to begin a new cycle as the dungeon rearranges itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/8b379a224fb608b6cd34223e94cc09b4.poster.avif?t=1768336690\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/8b379a224fb608b6cd34223e94cc09b4.webm?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/8b379a224fb608b6cd34223e94cc09b4.mp4?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Mastery Through Repetition</strong><br>A small, focused enemy roster designed to reward pattern recognition and player improvement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/01842ce29b9647e4ae23bb761c5b1d7e.poster.avif?t=1768336690\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/01842ce29b9647e4ae23bb761c5b1d7e.webm?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/01842ce29b9647e4ae23bb761c5b1d7e.mp4?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗡️ <strong>Face The Eternal Warden</strong><br>A heightened enemy encounter that serves as the dungeon’s final trial each cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/6e24814271c5724697aac73bc27e0696.poster.avif?t=1768336690\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/6e24814271c5724697aac73bc27e0696.webm?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/extras/6e24814271c5724697aac73bc27e0696.mp4?t=1768336690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Skill-Focused Progression</strong><br>Low-level progression places emphasis on player skill rather than stat scaling or grinding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT TO EXPECT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valor &amp; Blade is intentionally minimalist in scope.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>one gothic dungeon</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy types and behaviors <strong>do not change between cycles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy variety is limited and designed for mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss encounters are an elite variant rather than cinematic multi-phase battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenge comes from learning encounters, refining execution, and adapting to new dungeon layouts rather than discovering new content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CURRENT VERSION NOTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the <strong>1.0 launch</strong> of Valor &amp; Blade.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience is compact and focused</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional content and features may be added post-launch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player feedback will help shape future updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Souls-Inspired Dungeon Crawler. End the Cycle. Master the Blade.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/1a3d636e38fceee339c5c735a2fa914cbf66b683/header.jpg?t=1768336690", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/1ed0a34d7b9447fafbf4a202d4e90220993d12dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768336690", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941900/1ed0a34d7b9447fafbf4a202d4e90220993d12dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768336690", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5, AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1080 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Supports DirectX 11 and Vulka